  "historyNote": "#6577, eff 9-13-97 (formerly Bar 503.02); ss by #7323, eff 7-26-00; ss by #9221, INTERIM, eff 7-30-08; ss by #9345, eff 12-10-08; ss by #10808, eff 4-2-15; ss by #13205, eff 5-13-21",
